READ-OFF: the profiles are NOT concentrated at small w -- they spread to
w_max comparable to O_c itself, with mean depth growing with O_c.  The ratio
O_c / sum_w L_w 2^-w is the exact inverse-eta loss, and it is already 10^1-10^3
on these finite orbits.  So the carry pot does not see the deep strata at all:
that is the small-eta problem in its exact form.
